          "title": "BL thermodynamics Website Re-Design",
          "subHeading": "BL Thermodynamics specializes in advanced ammonia absorption chillers and heat pumps. The objective of the redesign was to translate heavy industrial engineering into a modern, accessible digital presence. The platform was developed to highlight the longevity and sustainability of the technology, positioning the company as a forward-thinking leader in the energy sector.",
